CreateOrder	Create an order per store and persist product snapshots.
AddShipping	Allow the owning store to propose a shipping amount.
RejectShipping	Allow the customer to reject a proposed shipping amount.
MarkPaid	Record trusted confirmation that payment succeeded.
CancelOrder	Cancel an order when its current state and actor permit it.
MarkSent	Let the owning store mark a paid order as dispatched.
ConfirmReceipt	Let the customer confirm receipt of a dispatched order.
GetOrderByID	Retrieve a single order with appropriate access checks.
ListMyOrders	List orders belonging to the authenticated customer.
ListStoreOrders	List orders belonging to a particular store, with authorization.